When you are unskilled in them, daggers are very weak weapons.  But
you had the 'sleep' spell. Put an enemy to sleep, walk up to it,
switch to your dagger, and poke it until it falls over.  After you
have done this a few times, you will be able to advance dagger to
basic.  At that point you can drop the quarterstaff, wield a dagger,
and throw your dagger stack until your enemies get within melee
range.  Some players will also name 'Sting', but I generally don't.
If you don't have the sleep spell, there are other relatively safe
ways to train up to basic in dagger, fighting lichen, grid bugs, and
so on.  Magicbane uses the dagger skill, so eventually you will need
it.

